  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Considers plain transient fields, fields annotated with <a href=\"../../annotation/Transient.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Transient</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Autowired.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Autowired</code></a> as\ntransient.",
      "translation": "将普通瞬态字段、带有 <a href=\"../../annotation/Transient.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Transient</code></a> 注解的字段，以及带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Autowired.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Autowired</code></a> 注解的字段视为瞬态。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Inspects a potentially available <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a> annotation at the property and returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> value of\nit.",
      "translation": "检查属性上是否存在潜在的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a>` 注解，并返回其 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>` 值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Considers the property an <a href=\"../Association.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>Association</code></a> if it is annotated with <a href=\"../../annotation/Reference.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Reference</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果该属性被<a href=\"../Association.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>Association</code></a>注解（即带有<a href=\"../../annotation/Reference.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Reference</code></a>注解），则将其视为一个关联。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.model 中的类\"><code>AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the property carries the annotation of the given type.",
      "translation": "返回该属性是否具有给定类型的注解。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the current property is writable, i.e. if the value held for it shall be written to the data store.",
      "translation": "返回当前属性是否可写，即其持有的值是否应写入数据存储。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>annotationType</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>annotationType</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
