      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the property is a <em>potential</em> identifier property of the owning <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>.\nThis method is mainly used by <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> implementation to discover id property candidates on\n<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> creation you should rather call <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html#isIdProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty)\"><code>PersistentEntity.isIdProperty(PersistentProperty)</code></a>\nto determine whether the current property is the id property of that <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> under consideration.",
      "translation": "返回该属性是否为所属<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>的<em>潜在</em>标识符属性。此方法主要由<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>实现类在创建<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>时用于发现标识符属性的候选项；若要确定当前属性是否为该<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>的标识符属性，您应调用<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html#isIdProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty)\"><code>PersistentEntity.isIdProperty(PersistentProperty)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the current property is a <em>potential</em> version property of the owning\n<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>. This method is mainly used by <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> implementation to discover version\nproperty candidates on <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> creation you should rather call\n<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html#isVersionProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty)\"><code>PersistentEntity.isVersionProperty(PersistentProperty)</code></a> to determine whether the current property is the\nversion property of that <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> under consideration.",
      "translation": "返回当前属性是否为所属<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>的<em>潜在</em>版本属性。此方法主要由<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>实现类用于在创建<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>时发现版本属性候选项；若要确定当前属性是否为所考虑的该<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>的版本属性，您应调用<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html#isVersionProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty)\"><code>PersistentEntity.isVersionProperty(PersistentProperty)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the type the property refers to in case it's an association, i.e. <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html#isAssociation()\"><code>PersistentProperty.isAssociation()</code></a> returns\ntrue. That means, that implementations <em>must</em> return a non-null value from this method\nin that case. We also recommend to return null for non-associations right away to establish symmetry\nbetween this method and <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html#isAssociation()\"><code>PersistentProperty.isAssociation()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果该属性是关联关系，则返回其对应的类型；即当<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html#isAssociation()\"><code>PersistentProperty.isAssociation()</code></a>返回true时。这意味着实现类在这种情况下<em>必须</em>从此方法返回一个非null值。此外，我们建议对于非关联关系直接返回null，以在此方法与<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html#isAssociation()\"><code>PersistentProperty.isAssociation()</code></a>之间建立对称性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the property is a <em>potential</em> identifier property of the owning <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回该属性是否为所属<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>的<em>潜在</em>标识属性。",
      "count": 1
