      "source": "Special <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> that takes annotations at a property into account.",
      "translation": "支持考虑属性注解的<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>特殊接口。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the annotation found for the current <a href=\"AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回当前 <a href=\"AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty</code></a> 找到的注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the annotation found for the current <a href=\"AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty</code></a>. Will prefer getters or\nsetters annotations over ones found at the backing field as the former can be used to reconfigure the metadata in\nsubclasses.",
      "translation": "返回当前 <a href=\"AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>AnnotationBasedPersistentProperty</code></a> 找到的注解。如果存在，将优先使用 getter 或 setter 上的注解，而不是底层字段上的注解，因为前者可用于在子类中重新配置元数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Looks up the annotation of the given type on the property and the owning type if no annotation can be found on it.",
      "translation": "如果在该属性上找不到注解，则查找该属性所属类型上的注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the type the property refers to in case it's an association, i.e.",
      "translation": "如果是关联，则返回该属性所引用的类型，即",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether property access shall be used for reading the property value.",
      "translation": "返回是否应使用属性访问来读取属性值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Looks up the annotation of the given type on the property and the owning type if no annotation can be found on it.\nUseful to lookup annotations that can be configured on the type but overridden on an individual property.",
      "translation": "在给定类型上查找属性的注解，如果在该属性上找不到注解，则在其所属类型上查找。  \n此方法适用于查找可在类型上配置但可被单个属性覆盖的注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether property access shall be used for reading the property value. This means it will use the getter\ninstead of field access.",
      "translation": "返回是否应使用属性访问来读取属性值。这意味着将使用 getter 而不是字段访问。",
      "count": 1
    },
